				<wikidot:authorName>Mateo115</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5336108</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Always nice to see GoI stuff and I think this is one that made especially good use of it's format. There was a lot of good world building here and I appreciated the insight into the decommission/termination approval process. I also enjoyed seeing the Foundation and GOC work together even if the termination of LTE-8686 is pretty tragic. Definitely an upvote for me.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
